{
  "name" : "He2017 - A mathematical model of pancreatic cancer with two kinds of treatments",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This is a mathematical model of pancreatic cancer which includes descriptions of regulatory T cell activity and inhibition therapy. Descriptions of cytokine induced killer immunotherapy are also included.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
